---
title: Molly Cake
author: Waitrose
tags: vegan, milk-free
cook time: 45 minutes
prep time: 15 minutes
servings: 8
---

Preheat the oven to 170°C, gas mark 3 and line a #900g loaf tin{} with baking parchment.

Put @dates{250%g} and @water{300%ml} in a pan and bring to the boil. Remove the pan from the heat and set aside.

Sieve @plain flour{85%g}, @baking powder{3%tsp} and @ground mixed spice{1%tsp} into a bowl. Add @wholemeal flour{85%g}, @dried mixed fruit{500%g} and @ground almonds{50%g} and stir to combine.

Stir in the wet date mixture and @orange juice{80%ml}. Mix well. Spoon into the loaf tin.

Bake for ~{45%minutes}, or until a skewer comes out clean. Turn out onto a wire rack and cool.
